  "portal_description": "JBoss Enterprise Web Server (EWS) is a fully integrated and certified set\nof components for hosting Java web applications. It is comprised of the\nindustry's leading Web Server (Apache HTTP Server), the popular Apache\nTomcat Servlet container as well as the mod_jk connector and the Tomcat\nNative library.\n\nThe introduction of EWS into the JBoss product line sees Tomcat officially\nsupported for the first time, creating an entry point for users of this\nservlet container.\n\nThis is the initial release of EWS. For detailed component and installation\ninformation see the Release Notes link in the References section.",
